        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE Lettings are delighted to present this excellent 2 bed / 2 bath apartment to the rental market in The Discovery Building, Ashtown, Dublin 15.\nThis superb location is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, shops and transport links, with both the LUAS and DART providing easy access to Dublin City Centre. The Phoenix Park and Castleknock are also just a short distance away.\nThe apartment comprises of an entrance hallway, two spacious double bedrooms with one ensuite, main bathroom and a bright open-plan living/dining area with fully fitted kitchen and integrated appliances.\nThe property also benefits from a private balcony overlooking a green area and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\nViewing is highly recommended contact RAY COOKE Lettings today to arrange an appointment.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 2 bed / 2 bath\n- Bright & Spacious Apartment\n- Fantastic condition throughout\n- Comes fully furnished\n- Top quality windows & doors\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\n- Top quality flooring\n- Very spacious rooms\n- Luxurious modern fitted wardrobes\n- Top quality blinds\n- Open plan kitchen/dining/living area\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Integrated appliances\n- Separate utility room\n- Ample additional storage\n- Main bathroom and master ensuite\n- Peaceful location\n- Located in the heart of Ashtown\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
